Description: Bellman's GAP Dynamic Programming Files Compiler 
 with modification for incorporating RNA 3D Motifs into RNA secondary structure predictions.
 Bellman's GAP is a domain specific language for describing dynamic
 programming algorithms on sequences at a high level. I.e.
 GAP-L programs do not contain indices or DP recurrences.
 GAP-C translates GAP-L programs into optimized C++ code.
